# Blender working files. tree_lowpoly.py regenerates the .blend and the .glb
# from scratch, and Blender embeds per-session state in a .blend, so the file
# differs byte for byte on every save while the exported .glb does not. The
# script is the source of record; the .blend is a build product.
assets/source/blender/*.blend
assets/source/blender/*.blend1
__pycache__/
